      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: \n\nThis `for` loop introduces two issues:\n1. Performance: Calling `clang-format` once per file is much slower than the previous `xargs` approach.\n2. Robustness: This will fail if any file path contains a space.\n\nFor the non-diff case, you should continue using `xargs`. For the `--diff` case, if your version of `clang-format` supports it, `--dry-run --Werror` is a faster way to check for formatting issues. If you need the actual diff output, you might consider a `while read` loop or a separate helper function to keep it efficient.",
