      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: \n\nCapturing output in a variable like `content\u003d$(...)` strips all trailing newlines. When you `echo \"$content\"`, a single newline is added back. This is why `docs/reference.md` changed in this CL.\n\nTo preserve the exact output of the command, use a temporary file:\n```bash\nout/gn help --markdown all \u003e docs/reference.md.tmp\nif \"${check}\"; then\n  diff -u docs/reference.md docs/reference.md.tmp\n  rm docs/reference.md.tmp\nelse\n  mv docs/reference.md.tmp docs/reference.md\nfi\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "1b72286bd67f4ea4ea6b254062c48f803b183d04",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
